            "sha256": "fa61190d97894480f232b65c1305b878bccecec068f536a28fd69a1b074e1a93",
            "start": 326,
            "end": 354,
            "quote": "# --soc_version\n\n#### 产品支持情况",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-6",
            "event_id": "call_cd53b8d231ce4558906b5a5b.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "fa61190d97894480f232b65c1305b878bccecec068f536a28fd69a1b074e1a93",
            "start": 1152,
            "end": 1230,
            "quote": "在安装昇腾AI处理器的服务器执行**npu-smi info**命令进行查询，获取**Chip Name**信息。实际配置值为AscendChip Name",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-7",
            "event_id": "call_5877105852fb4693bb5c6a03.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "23c0dd5068bd020f812e97ee67ae0aca03cbd56b6cc49e4a5cdefdb035d533cf",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 49,
            "quote": "**标题**: CANN算子清单-算子清单-CANN商用版6.0.1开发文档-昇腾社区\n\n获取效率",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-8",
            "event_id": "call_cd53b8d231ce4558906b5a5b.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "fa61190d97894480f232b65c1305b878bccecec068f536a28fd69a1b074e1a93",
            "start": 1408,
            "end": 1505,
            "quote": "实际配置值为Chip Name_NPU Name。例如**Chip Name**取值为Ascend*xxx*，**NPU Name**取值为1234，实际配置值为Ascend*xxx_*1234",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-9",
            "event_id": "call_cd53b8d231ce4558906b5a5b.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "fa61190d97894480f232b65c1305b878bccecec068f536a28fd69a1b074e1a93",
            "start": 777,
            "end": 830,
            "quote": "低版本的CANN软件包环境上转换出的om离线模型，支持在高版本的CANN软件包环境上运行，兼容4个版本周期",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-10",
            "event_id": "call_9ab13eb4c33a44d9a6448094.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "1ef95723c0d0f53c7b8cf30966ab9a516c9919a54e2129e1966a286bfa10a79f",
            "start": 942,
            "end": 1012,
            "quote": "4. [昇腾ATC模型转换工具 - 褚成志 - 博客园](https://www.cnblogs.com/chucz/p/20064184)",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-11",
            "event_id": "call_5f24773982354441be40c174.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "989d9c01cc6ad0568422572d775fd20b47d75c003b257c9270b644558f575ec8",
            "start": 311,
            "end": 408,
            "quote": "2. [ONNX 模型迁移到昇腾：算子不兼容怎么办_昇腾onnx-CSDN博客](https://blog.csdn.net/song501/article/details/161362150)",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-12",
            "event_id": "call_2ee0965625c94a4fa4d065e4.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "f63b3ecfabb86492fbf5206e2b960307f0991c7e84dd5c4f27a9d44d52e53225",
            "start": 94,
            "end": 187,
            "quote": "1. [昇腾 npu-smi：常用命令、Chip ID 与 NPU ID 辨析、910B ...](https://juejin.cn/post/7684203867400355878)",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-13",
            "event_id": "call_04fea1cc191940b3b0340d7a.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "11ecb93c8408d8f9a1637a43b4e61822cfbcef7c6b6405ec52b882907851bca8",
            "start": 3091,
            "end": 3189,
            "quote": "A2 训练/推理系列（910B）**：`npu-smi info` 看 Name 字段，前面加 `Ascend`，如 Name `910B4` → soc_version `Ascend910B4",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-14",
            "event_id": "call_c959488b833949dba74d838c.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "7f9b1361abef32fcd64e4b701022055ae16806f5ae579fd7f721632d75f981ef",
            "start": 4101,
            "end": 4147,
            "quote": "- `--soc_version`：指定NPU型号（Ascend310/Ascend910）",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-15",
            "event_id": "call_2e8d80eb170f4840a94bc3fc.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "cac54c03274cbd8ebd7806b541ac7aefaa03d8bf4f1e59d024aec003532f4de5",
            "start": 491,
            "end": 539,
            "quote": "Ascend C 算子从昇腾 910 迁移到昇腾 310P，往往不是简单地新增一个 SoC 名称",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-16",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "c7c54d4fd6ce1984647adf6ca983d9aeb69d8aac7f0946ef8575e5a72085e3bb",
            "start": 278,
            "end": 353,
            "quote": "迁移后必须用目标芯片对应的 `--soc_version`（如 Ascend310、Ascend310P3、Ascend910A/B）重新执行 ATC",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-17",
            "event_id": "client-note-00005",
            "field": "content",
            "sha256": "c7c54d4fd6ce1984647adf6ca983d9aeb69d8aac7f0946ef8575e5a72085e3bb",
            "start": 444,
            "end": 476,
            "quote": "不确定处：各代芯片 soc_version 的完整合法字符串列表",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-18",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "2f408455d252ab77a0ead3625f584e76711a521d2030c5606351ddbb97474f87",
            "start": 357,
            "end": 495,
            "quote": "非 Atlas A3 系列：在目标服务器执行 `npu-smi info`，取 `Chip Name`，实际配置值为 `Ascend<Chip Name>`（去掉空格），例如 Chip Name 为 `910B4` → `--soc_version=Ascend910B4`。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-19",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "2f408455d252ab77a0ead3625f584e76711a521d2030c5606351ddbb97474f87",
            "start": 256,
            "end": 321,
            "quote": "运行环境 CANN 版本须不低于转换环境；低版本 CANN 转出的 om 支持在高版本 CANN 环境运行，兼容 4 个版本周期。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-20",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "2f408455d252ab77a0ead3625f584e76711a521d2030c5606351ddbb97474f87",
            "start": 2282,
            "end": 2403,
            "quote": "atc --model=model.onnx --framework=5 --output=model_910 \\\n    --soc_version=Ascend910B4 --input_shape=\"input:1,3,224,224\"",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-21",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "2f408455d252ab77a0ead3625f584e76711a521d2030c5606351ddbb97474f87",
            "start": 2191,
            "end": 2255,
            "quote": "npu-smi info -t board -i 0 -c 0    # A3 系列取 Chip Name + NPU Name",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-22",
            "event_id": "run-end",
            "field": "answer",
            "sha256": "2f408455d252ab77a0ead3625f584e76711a521d2030c5606351ddbb97474f87",
            "start": 1005,
            "end": 1063,
            "quote": "迁移 310→910（或任意不同型号）时，旧 .om 不能直接用，须按上面方法查得目标芯片的准确 SoC 名后重转。",
            "json_escaped": false
          },
          {
            "id": "ev-23",
            "event_id": "call_cd53b8d231ce4558906b5a5b.result",
            "field": "response",
            "sha256": "fa61190d97894480f232b65c1305b878bccecec068f536a28fd69a1b074e1a93",
            "start": 585,
            "end": 652,
            "quote": "模型转换阶段不依赖昇腾AI处理器，但是转换时使用的--soc_version取值，必须为转换后模型运行阶段所使用的昇腾AI处理器型号。",
            "json_escaped": false
          }
        ],
